  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電腦輔助設計(一)",
    "sub_ename": "COMPUTER- AIDED DESIGN (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程止在培育學員具備3D創意設計以及製造整合的觀念, 深植3D Design and Maker的專業技能。以期發揮具備社會實踐精神的、無邊界的、” CDIO未來大學”理念。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is aimed to nurture students with 3D creative design and manufacturing integration concepts, deep into the 3D Design and Maker professional skills, and implements a view to play with the spirit of social practice, no border, \"CDIO future university\" ideal.",
